        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 35:6",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that Alma and his brethren did minister unto them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 35:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Now the people of the Zoramites were angry with the people of Ammon who were in Jershon, and the chief ruler of the Zoramites, being a very wicked man, sent over unto the people of Ammon desiring them that they should cast out of their land all those who came over from them into their land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "Alma 27:26."
          },
          {
            "start": 97,
            "end": 102,
            "text": "Alma 30:59."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
